# hiker_sit: the hiker, sitting on a rock or a log's top (GAME_DESIGN 11.6;
# BUILD_PLAN S5 brief B6): the same rust (8) jacket and cap, the
# paper-cream (5) face and its one ink (0) eye, slate (2) legs forward with
# the knee up and the boot on the ground, the brick (9) pack set down
# beside, on the left. Faces right. The anchor, 0,0, is the seat: the hips
# rest on it, and the legs and the pack hang below it. 7 wide, 13 tall.
C 8  L -1,-8 1,-8  L -1,-7 2,-7  L -1,-4 1,-4  L -1,-3 2,-3  L -1,-2 1,-2
C 5  L -1,-6 0,-6  L -1,-5 1,-5  L 2,-2
C 0  L 1,-6  L 2,3  L 2,4 3,4
C 9  L -3,-2 -2,-2  L -3,-1 -2,-1  L -3,0 -2,0  L -3,1 -2,1  L -3,2 -2,2
C 2  L -1,-1 2,-1  L -1,0 0,0  L 2,0 2,2
# The Look hotspot (S6): the hiker, sitting, in the stamp's coordinates.
Z hiker -3,-8,7,13
